OL,3,GNEWSA'I go without sleep because of 3am
OL,4,Afireworks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a town where "constant"
OL,7,Ffireworks are being set off late at
OL,8,Fnight have said they are "exhausted and
OL,9,Ffrustrated".
OL,11,FPeople living in Coppice, in Oldham,
OL,12,Fsaid they were woken up at night by
OL,13,Ffireworks being set off around wedding
OL,14,Fvenues or in car parks - despite it
OL,15,Fbeing illegal to set off fireworks past
OL,16,F23:00.
OL,18,F"It is constant during the wedding
OL,19,Fseason," said local Afruz Miah. "Some
OL,20,Fdays I go without sleep because I am
OL,21,Fwoken up at 03:00 by firework noise.
OL,22,FIt's frustrating."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
