OL,3,GNEWSA'I go without sleep because of 3am
OL,4,Afireworks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOldham Council said it was committed to
OL,7,Ftackling late-night fireworks, which
OL,8,Fcould cause unwanted "noise, littering
OL,9,Fand anti-social behaviour".
